WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.021 --> 00:00:05.384
For over a month, the travelers stayed at Squire Kou's house.

2
00:00:05.444 --> 00:00:08.346
Every time they tried to leave, the squire begged them to stay longer.

3
00:00:26.296 --> 00:00:31.078
Finally, one morning during breakfast, the Tang Monk insisted on leaving.

4
00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:34.960
"We'll never fetch the True Scriptures if we stay here."

5
00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:38.981
"Please don't leave," said Squire Kou.

6
00:00:40.062 --> 00:00:41.582
are very important monks.

7
00:00:41.982 --> 00:00:43.803
Having you as guests is a good deed."

8
00:00:45.484 --> 00:00:47.444
like to stay here," said Bajie.

9
00:00:48.245 --> 00:00:49.625
He took a bite of a peach.

10
00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:53.307
Master's right," said Wukong.

11
00:00:53.327 --> 00:00:56.960
"We must continue our journey."

12
00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.781
Kou grew angry.

13
00:00:58.801 --> 00:01:01.122
"You monks are ungrateful!

14
00:01:02.502 --> 00:01:04.363
have fed you and taken care of you.

15
00:01:05.444 --> 00:01:07.004
Yet you can't wait to leave!"

16
00:01:08.505 --> 00:01:10.366
are very grateful," said the Tang Monk.

17
00:01:10.386 --> 00:01:13.587
"But we cannot stay any longer."

18
00:01:15.928 --> 00:01:19.449
After breakfast Wujing got the horse from Squire Kou's stable.

19
00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:22.211
Bajie gathered the bags.

20
00:01:22.851 --> 00:01:27.445
The Tang Monk thanked Squire and Lady Kou, and the travelers headed west.

21
00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:35.132
"They are ungrateful," muttered Lady Kou.

22
00:01:40.216 --> 00:01:43.558
The next morning Lady Kou ran into the town's courthouse.

23
00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:46.561
filled her eyes.

24
00:01:46.581 --> 00:01:49.964
"I must speak with the judge!"

25
00:01:50.484 --> 00:01:51.045
she cried.

26
00:01:52.526 --> 00:01:53.607
judge rushed to her.

27
00:01:53.627 --> 00:01:55.652
"Lady Kou!

28
00:01:55.712 --> 00:01:56.292
What's wrong?"

29
00:01:57.292 --> 00:02:01.494
"Robbers broke into our house last night," said Lady Kou breathlessly.

30
00:02:01.514 --> 00:02:06.395
"They stole many valuable items and two of our horses.

31
00:02:07.415 --> 00:02:17.278
Squire Kou tried to stop them, but the robbers killed my husband!"

32
00:02:17.338 --> 00:02:19.279
Lady Kou burst into tears.

33
00:02:20.219 --> 00:02:21.239
judge gasped.

34
00:02:21.259 --> 00:02:22.239
"Oh no!

35
00:02:22.760 --> 00:02:25.376
Did you see the robbers?"

36
00:02:25.956 --> 00:02:26.597
Kou sniffed.

37
00:02:26.617 --> 00:02:29.779
"Yes, and I know who they are."

38
00:02:29.859 --> 00:02:31.700
"Who are they?"

39
00:02:32.020 --> 00:02:32.740
asked the judge.

40
00:02:34.001 --> 00:02:35.281
Kou gritted her teeth.

41
00:02:35.301 --> 00:02:38.323
"The Tang Monk and his companions!"

42
00:02:41.085 --> 00:02:42.765
The judge turned to a soldier.

43
00:02:42.785 --> 00:02:47.188
"Gather some soldiers and arrest the Tang Monk and his companions!"

44
00:02:51.252 --> 00:02:55.033
glad we're headed west again," said the Tang Monk as the travelers walked.

45
00:02:56.714 --> 00:02:58.614
"I'm eager to reach the Western Paradise."

46
00:03:00.155 --> 00:03:03.736
nodded. "We were delayed at Squire Kou's house for too long."

47
00:03:04.956 --> 00:03:08.017
snorted. "We should have stayed longer."

48
00:03:09.717 --> 00:03:12.598
Suddenly a group of men stepped onto the road.

49
00:03:14.198 --> 00:03:15.899
carried swords and axes.

50
00:03:17.159 --> 00:03:20.780
Their horses carried several large bundles.

51
00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:21.961
"Give us your money!"

52
00:03:22.361 --> 00:03:23.282
shouted one man.

53
00:03:25.583 --> 00:03:27.864
Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

54
00:03:30.526 --> 00:03:31.426
said the Tang Monk.

55
00:03:32.527 --> 00:03:34.768
"Remember, you must not harm people."

56
00:03:36.589 --> 00:03:39.431
smiled. "I'm just going to talk to them, Master."

57
00:03:41.592 --> 00:03:43.373
turned to the man who had shouted.

58
00:03:43.393 --> 00:03:45.194
"We have no money."

59
00:03:46.695 --> 00:03:47.955
"No money, huh?"

60
00:03:48.295 --> 00:03:48.896
said the man.

61
00:03:49.948 --> 00:03:52.749
"Well then, we're going to beat up all of you."

62
00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:58.211
laughed. "You don't realize who I am.

63
00:03:59.472 --> 00:04:01.933
I'm Sun Wukong, the Monkey King!"

64
00:04:03.474 --> 00:04:05.955
"I don't care who you are," said the man.

65
00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:08.616
dangerous robbers!

66
00:04:09.576 --> 00:04:12.257
Last night we robbed a very wealthy squire."

67
00:04:15.399 --> 00:04:17.679
The Tang Monk raised his eyebrows.

68
00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:18.700
"A squire?"

69
00:04:19.904 --> 00:04:23.306
Wukong quickly recited a spell, which froze the robbers.

70
00:04:25.366 --> 00:04:28.628
Wujing rushed to the horses and opened one of the bundles.

71
00:04:29.808 --> 00:04:33.310
Inside were dishes, jewels, and other valuable items.

72
00:04:35.090 --> 00:04:38.772
gasped. "These items belong to Squire Kou!

73
00:04:39.672 --> 00:04:40.513
So do the horses!"

74
00:04:41.873 --> 00:04:43.534
The Tang Monk bit his lip.

75
00:04:44.654 --> 00:04:45.595
Kou is a good man.

76
00:04:46.455 --> 00:04:49.696
We must return his belongings."

77
00:04:51.817 --> 00:04:56.259
agreed. Wukong recited another spell, and the robbers became unfrozen.

78
00:04:57.039 --> 00:05:00.601
The monkey grew large, and fire burned in his eyes.

79
00:05:02.122 --> 00:05:02.962
out of here!"

80
00:05:03.342 --> 00:05:03.982
he thundered.

81
00:05:04.002 --> 00:05:06.563
"And never steal again!"

82
00:05:08.044 --> 00:05:10.685
The robbers screamed and ran away.

83
00:05:14.007 --> 00:05:17.028
The travelers headed back toward town with the squire's horses.

84
00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:21.161
Soon they saw a group of soldiers on horseback.

85
00:05:22.581 --> 00:05:25.322
"Those soldiers are riding toward us," said Wujing.

86
00:05:25.342 --> 00:05:28.243
"I wonder what they want," said the Tang Monk.

87
00:05:29.204 --> 00:05:31.985
One of the soldiers pointed a sword at the travelers.

88
00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:33.945
"Stop, thieves!

89
00:05:34.245 --> 00:05:35.546
You're all under arrest!"
